+                /* SC-1 (2026-09-05, benchmark run): diagnose before dying.
+                 * store_init is asm (bitcoin_store) and its failure path is
+                 * opaque from here; capture what a C caller CAN see, then
+                 * fail this child only. Two changes:
+                 *   (a) log errno plus the datadir-relative files store_init
